<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine Oct industrial production up 17.5 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Oct industrial production up 17.5 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial production in Ukraine rose 17.5 percent in October but was still 9.5 percent lower than a year earlier, the Statistics Ministry said.</p>
<p>UKRAINE INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION  OCT 96  SEPT 96  OCT 95</p>
<p> mth/mth change (percent)	 +17.5   -1.2     -18.0</p>
<p> year/year change (percent)	-9.5   -5.5     -14.0</p>
<p>With the exception of October and March, Ukrainian industrial output has declined every month this year.</p>
<p>The overall decline in production is 4.9 percent since the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>--Yuri Kulikov, Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
